<title>Hemophilia: Diagnosis.</title>
<graphic href="eee0264-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Personal or family history of bleeding: Order PT, APTT, fibrinogen</label>
<path target="cell-2"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>PT prolonged, Fibrinogen reduced.</label>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-4">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-3">
<label>Hemophilia excluded. Consider another bleeding disorder.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>PT and fibrinogen normal, APTT prolonged.</label>
<path target="cell-5">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-6">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Request factor VIII and IX and Von Willebrand factor (VWF)</label>
<path target="cell-7"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-7">
<label>All normal?</label>
<path target="cell-9">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-8">
<label>Factor VIII low, VWF normal.</label>
<path target="cell-11">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-10">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-10">
<label>Low factor VIII and VWF.</label>
<path target="cell-13">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-12">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-12">
<label>Factor IX low.</label>
<path target="cell-14"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-14">
<label>Hemophilia B.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-13">
<label>Von Willebrand's disease.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-11">
<label>Hemophilia A.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-9">
<label>Consider another bleeding disorder.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>Hemophilia not present.</label>
</cell>
<footnotes>
<footnote>Data from World Federation of Hemophilia Guidelines for the Management of Hemophilia: http:&#x002F;&#x002F;www.wfh.org&#x002F;2&#x002F;docs&#x002F;Publications&#x002F;Diagnosis&#x005F;and&#x005F;Treatment&#x002F;Guidelines&#x005F;Mng&#x005F;Hemophilia.pdf<xref ref="web001" />
</footnote>
</footnotes>
